      "message": "I\u0027m not sure. This mimics what we already do elsewhere: https://github.com/google/skia/blob/117b7cafa814a51b0aee5b6c0d79509cad9c8fb1/src/core/SkTypefaceCache.cpp#L66\n\nIn any case, I deleted this Mutex and replaced it with SkOnce.",
